      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re excited to announce that new Amazon SageMaker AI customers can now land inside a fully configured Amazon SageMaker Studio environment in only a few steps after signing up for AWS.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/developers-can-now-access-sagemaker-studio-through-the-new-aws-experience/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T22:39:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-20T00:31:20.244Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "New customers also receive $100 in AWS Free Tier credits that work across SageMaker AI, including model customization, training jobs, Studio notebooks, and endpoint deployments.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/developers-can-now-access-sagemaker-studio-through-the-new-aws-experience/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T22:39:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-20T00:31:20.244Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This post follows on from our previous post, From Hugging Face to Amazon SageMaker Studio in One Click , which introduced deep links from Hugging Face model pages directly into SageMaker Studio workflows.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/developers-can-now-access-sagemaker-studio-through-the-new-aws-experience/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T22:39:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-20T00:31:20.244Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Earlier this year, we also sped up Studio environment creation time from 2 minutes to about 20 seconds and pre-configured model customization permissions in every new Studio domain.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/developers-can-now-access-sagemaker-studio-through-the-new-aws-experience/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T22:39:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-20T00:31:20.244Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With this launch, SageMaker Studio is now integrated with the updated AWS sign-in and sign-up experience , which introduces new options for creating and managing AWS accounts along with simplified collaboration.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/developers-can-now-access-sagemaker-studio-through-the-new-aws-experience/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T22:39:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-20T00:31:20.244Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "New customers can create an account using an identity that they already have and start building in SageMaker Studio right away.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/developers-can-now-access-sagemaker-studio-through-the-new-aws-experience/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T22:39:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-20T00:31:20.244Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "After you sign up, SageMaker AI automatically creates your Studio environment in about 20 seconds.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/developers-can-now-access-sagemaker-studio-through-the-new-aws-experience/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T22:39:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-20T00:31:20.244Z"
      },
      {
